# Security headers for Cloudflare Workers Static Assets
# https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers/static-assets/headers/
/*
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=()
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy: same-origin

# Version previews are public workers.dev URLs. While workers.dev is the canonical
# production host, review previews must not be linked or submitted for indexing.
# After a custom domain becomes canonical, add a host-specific workers.dev rule
# with X-Robots-Tag: noindex and verify it against production and preview hosts.
